'''Description:''' Clerics who take the Fire domain command power over creatures of the Elemental Planes and are granted spells that summon and protect against fire.[[Image:Id fire.gif|right|Fire]]
== Domain Special Abilities ==

Able to [[Turn undead|turn]] [[elemental]]s as if they were [[undead]].

== Bonus Spells ==
* Level 4 [[Wall of fire]]
* Level 5 [[Energy buffer]]

==Notes==
*The cleric can turn elementals without penalty as if they were undead.
*[[Sun domain]] improves the strength of turning.

